pmentstudio"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Paradox Interactive","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/paradoxinteractive"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Hearts of Iron","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/HeartsOfIron"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"在[i]《Hearts of Iron IV》[/i]中指挥历史上最强大的战争机器，这是一款挑战您的战略能力和政治洞察力的大型战略战争游戏。化身为二战时期的国家首脑，打造工业强国、构建外交联盟，向意识形态对手发动战争。\r\n\r\n[img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/HOI_gif_lead_your_nation.gif?t=1747327288[/img]\r\n\r\n[i]《Hearts of Iron IV》[/i]不仅仅是一款历史模拟游戏。您所做几乎的每一个决定都会开启另一种历史进程，小到从何处发动进攻以攻破欧洲的堡垒，大到是重建民主政体还是早已被遗忘的君主政体。\r\n\r\n[img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/HOI_gif4_grandStrategy.gif?t=1747327288[/img]\r\n\r\n在[i]《Hearts of Iron IV》[/i]中，您可以钜细靡遗地规划军队战略，包括为您的军队设计师编制、研究新的生产模式和破坏手段、制定工厂指令和追求政治目标。带领您所选择的国家度过人类最黑暗时刻这一过程中，您将触及这场世界大战的方方面面。\r\n\r\n[h2]本次购买包括《Hearts of Iron IV》游戏本体和三个扩展包：[/h2]\r\n\r\n[list][*][b]《Death or Dishonor》[/b]聚焦于东欧和中欧中等强国\r\n[*][b]《Together for Victory》[/b]聚焦于英联邦国家\r\n[*][b]《Waking the Tiger》[/b]聚焦于中国和日本[/list]\r\n\r\n[img]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394360/extras/HOI_gif_accolades.gif?t=1747327288[/img]","strSnippet":"Victory is at your fingertips! Your ability to lead your nation is your supreme weapon, the strategy game Hearts of Iron IV lets you take command of any nation in World War II; the most engaging conflict in world history."}}]]